Cell["\<\
For the purposes of explaining our visualization process, important functions \
were broken up into separate code cells for display that cannot run. Please \
ensure the following closed code cell, which is just those in the above \
section combined properly, is executed along with the rest of the cells, to \
define and enable our toolbox\[CloseCurlyQuote]s visualization functionality.\
